  "contract": [
    "Report #13561: Scarlet Armbands for The Scarlet Crusade (381) dropped too rarely. Scarlet Convert 1506,",
    "Scarlet Initiate 1507 and Meven Korgal 1667 dropped Scarlet Armband 3266 at 70% (stock AzerothCore data);",
    "Ascension drops it at 100% while the quest needs it (db.exil.es dump of 2026-10-04, creature_loot chance 100).",
    "rev_20261125_13561 raises the three rows to 100%. An Undead on 381 without armbands kills three Converts and",
    "three Initiates one at a time; every corpse must offer exactly one armband and all six reach the bags. At 100%",
    "the outcome is deterministic; on the old 70% data all six corpses offer one with probability 0.7^6 = 0.12."
  ],
